| M | [Agreement mobile viewport](r9-390.png) | 390 x 844 |
| DF | [Agreement desktop full](shots/r9-1440-full.png) | 1440 x 3736 |
| MF | [Agreement mobile full](shots/r9-390-full.png) | 390 x 6188 |
