    93	        <p className="lede">The team placed this supply with a contract that sells it on the HyperCore spot book, at most {cap} HYPE a day, never below ${fmt8(s.floor, 2)}. No one can change or cancel these terms, the team included.</p>
    94	      </div>
    95	      <nav className="jumps" aria-label="Sections">{[['c1', 'Terms'], ['c6', 'Sales'], ['status', 'Status'], ['judges', 'For judges'], ['business', 'Business']].map(([id, t]) => <button key={id} className="btn-text" onClick={() => document.getElementById(id)?.scrollIntoView()}>{t}</button>)}</nav>
    96	      {known ? <Staircase start={Number(s.start)} end={Number(s.end)} cap={cap} deposited={deposited} fills={fills} fillsErr={fillsErr} /> : <figure className="fig1"><div className="fig1-head"><p className="fig1-n">Figure 1</p><h2>Ceiling and fills, HYPE</h2></div><p role="status">{fillsErr ? 'The fill history from HyperCore has not loaded, so this figure is not drawn. It retries every 20 seconds.' : 'Loading the fill history from HyperCore.'}</p></figure>}
    97	    </section>
    98	
    99	    <div className="cols">
   100	      <article className="doc">
   101	        <ol className="clauses">
   102	          <li id="c1"><h2>Tokens locked</h2>
   103	            <p><span className="fig">{known ? '' : 'at least '}{+deposited.toFixed(4)} HYPE</span> deposited. <span className="fig">{fmt8(s.balance)} HYPE</span> is still locked on HyperCore (read live from HyperCore), and <span className="fig">{soldTxt}</span> has been sold for <span className="fig">{procTxt}</span>, which the contract holds until the end date.</p></li>
   104	          <li id="c2"><h2>Maximum sale per day</h2>
