   113	            </TableBody></Table></li>
   114	          <li id="c4"><h2>Cannot cancel</h2>
   115	            <p>The contract has no cancel and no early-withdraw path. Each check below simulates the call against the live contract. It is read-only: no wallet, no gas, nothing is sent.</p>
